    "forecast": "low",
    "rationale": "Reviewed prompt, tool manifest, and runtime notes. The design is a narrow Q&A agent with one read-only internal search capability and a reply channel bound to the authenticated requester. Under rubric section 5a, a reply to the authenticated requester is not egress, so there is no present untrusted-to-sensitive path above low. Verified network-layer egress denial and least-privilege read-only credentials materially limit misuse. Manual validation was applied because scripts could not be run. Confidence is reduced for repudiation and some availability properties because audit and service resilience details were not provided."
  },
